Description: By the Pond, 4k intro by tkln (Assembly 2018)
 By the Pond is a 4k intro written by tkln (code, graphics and music),
 released at Assembly 2018 where it ranked 12th in the combined 4k compo.
 .
 The whole scene, a pond with a water lily floating on it, is raymarched
 in a single OpenGL 3.3 fragment shader.
 .
 The intro is only available as a precompiled x86-64 binary. It opens
 libGL and SDL 1.2 at run time with dlopen.
